ct/PayPal\nהזדמנות: Accounting ליוצרי קורסים ישראלים\n\nשורה תחתונה (בולטת): המספרים גלובליים. הבסיס הישראלי לא ידוע ולא מתוקף — לא נכנס לתחזית עד שיבדק.\n\nאנגלית:\n\nTitle: Future Opportunity: Global Platform Ecosystem\nSubtitle: The same pain as Wix, at global scale. Not yet locally validated.\n\nCard 1 — Elementor\n21M+ websites globally · 2-3M on paid tier · Israeli company (Ramat Gan)\nNo native payments — fully dependent on Stripe\nOpportunity: Accounting for Israeli merchants — not competing with Stripe, complementing it\n\nCard 2 — BuddyBoss\n50,000+ customers globally · Clients: Stanford, MIT, Yale\nNo native payments — dependent on WooCommerce/Stripe\nOpportunity: Accounting for Israeli course/community creators\n\nCard 3 — LearnDash\n~55,000-160,000 sites globally\nNo native payments — dependent on Stripe Connect/PayPal\nOpportunity: Accounting for Israeli course creators\n\nBottom line (bold): These are global figures. The Israeli user base is unknown and unvalidated — excluded from the forecast until confirmed.</message>"}
