n the VM.\n- *Limitation:* It's a remote *human* terminal, not an agent-to-agent API; you're typing, not orchestrating programmatically.\n\n**Honest gaps:** Anthropic's **Remote Control** and **Dispatch** are the slickest phone experiences and keep execution on your VM, but they're explicitly human-in-the-loop (QR scan, mobile app) and store transcripts on Anthropic servers — **not designed to be driven by another agent**, and Remote Control refuses to run when `ANTHROPIC_BASE_URL` points at a gateway/proxy (relevant if the VM routes Claude through OneCLI). For a *programmatic assistant-driven* flow, options 1–2 are the real answer; 3–4 are for when a human in chat is acceptable.\n\nSources: [Anthropic headless docs](https://docs.anthropic.com/en/docs/claude-code/sdk/sdk-headless) · [Agent SDK](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-agent-sdk-typescript) · [Remote Control docs](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/remote-control) · [Channels docs](https://code.claude.com/docs/en/channels) · [coder/agentapi](https://github.com/coder/agentapi) · [mberg/agent-http](https://github.com/mberg/agent-http) · [slopus/happy](https://github.com/slopus/happy) · [omnara-ai/omnara](https://github.com/omnara-ai/omnara) · [siteboon/claudecodeui](https://github.com/siteboon/claudecodeui) · [QuivrHQ/247-claude-code-remote](https://github.com/QuivrHQ/247-claude-code-remote) · [nanocoai/nanoclaw](https://github.com/nanocoai/nanoclaw)"}],"resolvedModel":"claude-opus-4-8","totalDurationMs":123087,"totalTokens":79956,"totalToolUseCount":13,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20323,"cache_read_input_tokens":54901,"output_tokens":4730,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":20323},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4730,"cache_read_input_tokens":54901,"cache_creation_input_tokens":20323,"cache_creation":{"e